  "description": "A production-grade C# library for converting data between JSON, YAML, TOML, and TOON (Token-Oriented Object Notation) with full TOON SPEC v2.0 compliance. Features direct JSON string serialization (JsonElement), POCO object serialization via reflection, YAML/TOML bidirectional conversion, parallel processing, and Span<T> optimizations. Perfect for cross-ecosystem configuration management.",
